<Prose
  title="About NiftyFix"
  description="What NiftyFix is, how its tools work, and what it promises."
  path="/about/"
>
  <p>
    NiftyFix makes files ready for the place you need to upload them. Application portals, email and
    chat apps all have rules about dimensions, file size and format. Our tools produce a file that
    meets the rules you enter, then measure the result and show you each requirement passing or
    failing.
  </p>
  <h2>What we promise</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Basic tools are free, with no account, no trial and no payment surprises after you have done
      the work.
    </li>
    <li>
      Files are processed on your device, inside an isolated frame that cannot send them anywhere.
    </li>
    <li>
      If we cannot meet a requirement, we tell you why instead of producing a file that only looks
      right.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <h2>What we do not promise</h2>
  <p>
    Portals can apply checks they do not publish, such as face detection or live photo capture. We
    verify the technical requirements you give us; we cannot guarantee that a portal will accept a
    file.
  </p>
</Prose>
